<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Echling upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Echling upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Echlin Inc to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said Echlin's intermediate-term rating remained accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Echlin gained 1 to 36-1/8.</p>
</text>
